00:01:21.130 --> 00:01:29.860
He is well entrenched in the analysis of big
data, leading teams to work in prediction

00:01:29.860 --> 00:01:31.039
competitions.

00:01:31.039 --> 00:01:41.530
A couple of the notable ones that his team
